    "body": "The existing [WPT](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/59568) covers `disconnect/reconnect`, but not events or `readyState`.\r\n\r\nBefore extending it, I'd like to confirm the expected behavior: entering or restoring from BFCache fires no `error`, a successful reconnection fires `open`, and real connection failures keep the normal error handling.\r\n\r\nDoes this make sense? I’ll add event/state coverage once we agree on the behavior.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-12T19:22:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-12T19:22:52Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12381#discussion_r3997286585",
