    "body": "If we consider entry of bfcache and restore out of bfcache as a normal \"network hiccup -> reestablish connection\" then I think the expected behavior would be upon bfcache-restore:\r\n\r\n- witness an `error` event (because the previous connection was closed)\r\n\r\nthen when trying to reconnect either:\r\n- witness an `open` event if reconnection succeeded\r\nor\r\n- witness an `error` event if reconnection failed\r\n\r\nRight?",
    "created_at": "2026-09-24T10:27:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-24T10:31:47Z",
